add_dft_control_points command is used to control the select signal of an existing clock 
multiplexer; the add_dft_clock_enable command is not used to control that signal because the 
clock multiplexer must be controlled in scan test mode too. 
The report_dft_clock_enables command is used in analysis mode with and without the 
-post_drc option to show the specified clock enables and those extracted during DRC. The 
specified clock enables can exist on pins or ports of the current design or on ports of any 
sub-module. During DRC, the clock enables specified on the ports of sub-modules are mapped 
to pins. Only the clock enable signals that affect the memory clocking are kept.
