Usage
report_edt_blocks
Description
Displays a list of the current user-defined EDT block names (also referred to as block tags) and 
indicates which one, if any, represents the current block. 
When the display shows “current block” by a name, it indicates relevant tool commands apply 
only to the EDT block associated with that name. 
You can transfer this restriction (also referred to as the EDT context) to another EDT block with 
the set_current_edt_block or add_edt_blocks commands.

