Each chain in the report contains an ordered list of scan cells characterized by three parameters: 
cell_id, ordered list of memory elements and ordered list of logic elements (interconnect 
elements between the current and next scan cell). Order of all elements reflect their appearance 
in scan chain (tracing from scan chain output to scan chain input). The list of memory elements 
always contains at least the “MASTER” element. The list of logic elements can contain no 
elements.

