Example 2
The following example creates a scan interface with two chains with the port pairs si_1 and 
so_1 as well as si_2 and so_2.
set_current_design top
add_icl_scan_interfaces { intf_1 } -chains { chain_1 chain_2 }
set_icl_scan_interface_ports -name intf_1 -ports { ce se ue }
set_icl_scan_interface_ports -name intf_1 -ports { si_1 so_1 } -chain chain_1
set_icl_scan_interface_ports -name intf_1 -ports { si_2 so_2 } -chain chain_2
The resulting ICL model would look like this:
Module top{
