By default, the tool writes Verilog to a file in the following manner after scan insertion in an 
RTL-based flow:
module top;
/* Tessent RTL-Based Scan Insertion Ports Start */
  input w1,w2,w3;
  wire w1,w2,w3;
/* Tessent RTL-Based Scan Insertion Ports End */
endmodule
The tool writes the following with “-declare_created_ports_nets_one_per_line on”:
module top;
/* Tessent RTL-Based Scan Insertion Ports Start */
  input w1;
  input w2;
  input w3;
  wire w1;
  wire w2;
  wire w3;
/* Tessent RTL-Based Scan Insertion Ports End */
endmodule
