generated. When this property is set to on and a DftSpecification/LogicBist/Controller 
wrapper is not specified, the EDT is set for LBIST-ready hybrid EDT/LBIST insertion. 
When this property is set to off, then the controller is a standard EDT controller (non-
hybrid) that is not usable by LBIST. 
By default, auto resolves to on when a DftSpecification/LogicBist/Controller is specified; 
otherwise it resolves to off. The default is auto.
• capture_per_cycle : on | off | auto ;
An optional property that specifies whether observation scan is used in the LBIST-ready 
block. By default, auto resolves to off when the capture_per_cycle DFT signal is not added; 
otherwise it is on.

