• min_switching_threshold_percentage : int ;
An optional property that specifies the minimum switching threshold value used to 
determine power controller parameters, such as input shift register size. Valid integer values 
are 1 to 50. If an integer greater than 50 is specified, the tool uses 50. This is equivalent to 
