example, if a module and a top-level instance have the same name) by using the order in the 
preceding list. Avoid ambiguity by fully specifying instance pathnames. You can specify the 
OCC generated in the same pass only by using its ID as Occ(<id>).
Refer to the Examples section to see a sample usage of this property.
