Note
For SSN, additional muxing logic is added to EDT pipeline stages to avoid capture 
mismatches. Affected pipeline stages are also clocked by the shift_capture_clock output of 
the corresponding SSH instance instead of the edt_clock. These hardware modifications are 
only included when using the following configuration:
• The EDT controller is connected to an SSH.
• The EDT input or output channels require one or more pipeline stages.
• The EDT controller has a bypass mode included.
