OCC wrapper. That example explains the functional clocking, with the localized functional 
clock trees and the forward and loop timing interfaces. Optimally, the IJTAG network clocking 
is similar to the functional mode, where the TCK clock trees are localized to each tile and the 
leaf node of one tree sources the TCK clock of the adjacent tiles. Figure 15-6 shows a schematic 
representation of the IJTAG network used in the tiled design used in Example 4 in the OCC 
wrapper reference section.

