controller are user-specifiable using the Interface wrappers. BoundaryScan host ports are 
present when the Tap/HostBScan wrapper is specified. The device id register is present when 
the Tap/DeviceIDRegister wrapper is specified. Finally, the IJTAG host ports are present when 
one or more HostIjtag wrappers are specified. The bypass register is required and always 
present.

