Description
InSystemTest is an optional wrapper within the DftSpecification that you use to generate and 
optionally insert an in-system test (IST) controller in the design. You can run in-system tests 
during power up of the device (Power-On Self Test or POST) or run on demand during system 
operation.
Configuration-Based Specification
