Description
An optional wrapper that groups properties related to the direct memory access controller. 
The begin_address and end_address arguments specify the memory space that is utilized for in-
system test when sharing with a functional memory. The controller address counter is set to 
begin_address when the controller is reset. The tool generates an error message during pattern 
generation if the entire program does not fit in memory between the begin_address and 
end_address.
