• begin_address : integer ;
An optional property used to specify the begin address for the memory block. The default is 
0.
• end_address : integer ;
An optional property used to specify the end address for the memory block. The default is 
the max addressable memory size.
• address_width : integer ;
A required property used to specify the design memory width. 
• max_wait_cycles : integer ;
An optional property used to specify the max wait cycles. The default is 1 million cycles, 
which corresponds to a 20-bit wait register.

