As shown in Figure 15-53, the boundary scan interface module resides between the TAP 
controller and the boundary scan chain. The normal logic included in the interface module is 
shown in black in Figure 15-54 and includes the clock gaters to create the bscan_update_clock 
and bscan_shift_capture_clock signals used by some boundary scan cells. See the 
Implemen

