• Pipeline/so_retiming : on | off ;
An optional property and boolean pair that specifies whether the pipeline register is a 
negedge or posedge clocked register. The default setting of “on” specifies a negedge 
register.
The presence of the negedge register reduces setup margin by half a clock period, however 
it simplifies the BISR hold timing closure with the addition of a half clock period of margin. 
