can, however, specify different IJTAG host nodes for different SSN nodes. You can also 
control the ordering of the daisy chaining using the ijtag_connection_order property within 
each node. See the ijtag_connection_order property description in the 
BusFrequencyDivider, BusFrequencyMultiplier, Multiplexer, OutputPipeline, Pipeline, 
Receiver1xPipeline, and ScanHost wrappers for more information on how to control the 
ordering and the location of the IJTAG attach points to the IJTAG network.

