Description
A wrapper used to create a branch out of the SSN data path that typically ends back on the 
secondary bus data in port of a Multiplexer node inside another block. All child nodes that can 
be specified in the Datapath wrapper can be specified in the ExtraOutputPath wrapper. The 
bus_data_in source of the extra output path is the bus_data_out ports of the nodes in which the 
ExtraOutputPath wrapper is located unless the ExtraOutputPath wrapper is located directly 
inside the Datapath wrapper in which case the bus_data_in source of the extra output path is the 
bus_data_in of the Datapath wrapper itself. 
