Once you have used an early clock branch to source the clock of the OutputPipeline node, there 
is little hold margin for any nodes following the OutputPipeline node. This is the reason to use 
an OutputPipeline node instead of a normal Pipeline. The fact that you instructed the CTS flow 
to use an early clock branch to it would not be captured in the ICL and the extract_icl command 
would not report an error if you added another node after it.
