A parameterization flow wrapper that describes a multi-level parameterized hierarchical design, 
including any uniquification requirements.
Usage
ParameterizedDesignSpecification(top_root_module_name,design_level) {
                  // design_level legal: physical_block chip sub_block
  uniquification_prefix : prefix ;
  uniquification_suffix : suffix ; // default: _pv#
  Block(root_module_name,design_level) {
                  // design_level legal: physical_block chip sub_block
    uniquification_prefix : prefix ;
    UniquificationGroup {
      Instances {
        hierarchical_instance_path ; // repeatable
      }
    }
  }
}
Description
The ParameterizedDesignSpecification wrapper is the primary input to the 
process_parameterized_design_specification command.
Note
The top_root_module_name of the ParameterizedDesignSpecification wrapper must match 
the module name of the current design.
Arguments
