Description
All ports are pre-created on each tile module in a tiling flow, and those are pre-connected into 
the chip-level netlist. You may already have an automated way of doing this for all your 
functional ports, and you may use the same flow to include the DFT ports. If you create your 
chip-level netlist by hand and it does not include the DFT ports, you can use this configuration 
syntax to define them and use the process_top_module_connections command to insert and 
connect them. Use the ChildBlock wrapper to describe the DFT ports of all child physical 
blocks in the CurrentDesign wrapper to describe the DFT ports on the current design.

