A property that specifies that the repair analysis status registers are examined after the BIST 
run is completed. The status registers identify whether the memories with built-in 
redundancy require no repair, is repairable or is unrepairable. Valid values are:
At least one memory tested by the controller must have repair analysis defined in its 
