Specifies the creation of an SSN continuity pattern to test the internal path of the ScanHost from 
input to output.
Usage
PatternsSpecification(design_name,design_id,pattern_id) {
Patterns(patterns_name) {
    SSNContinuityVerify(id) {
      verify_datapaths_simultaneously : on | off ; // default: on
