A property that controls the visibility of the data wrapper. When set to normal, the data 
wrapper is reported by report_config_syntax and visible in the Config Data Browser. When 
set to hidden, the data wrapper is not reported by report_config_syntax and invisible in the 
Config Data Browser. Its content can still be fetched and edited using the configuration 
introspection and editing commands such as the get_config_value command if the name of 
the hidden data wrapper is known to you. The “Usage : Env(EnvVar)” is treated as normal if 
the EnvVar environment variable is defined and set to 1; otherwise it is treated as hidden.

