Tessent Shell Data Base (TSDB)
The Tessent Shell Database is a structured directory containing subdirectories and files. The 
subdirectory naming is designed to group related information for each specific view of each 
design block. The complete subdirectory is deleted and recreated cleanly when a step is 
repeated to ensure that no stale files from a previous run remain in the active TSDB directory.

