Description
A port function that declares the name of the data inout port (bidirectional data port) of a 
Module.
This port function is not part of the IEEE 1687-2014 standard. Its only use model within Tessent 
is the representation of the SPIO port of the Two-Pin Serial Port (TPSP) interface (see 
“TwoPinSerialPort” on page 4355). It cannot be used for any other purpose.

